# meme position, coups differents testes (reprise directe vs promotion)
3n3r/2P5/8/1k6/8/8/3Q4/4K3 w - -; Qxd8; N
3n3r/2P5/8/1k6/8/8/3Q4/4K3 w - -; cxd8=Q; (N + Q - P) - Q + R

r2n3r/2P1P3/4N3/1k6/8/8/8/4K3 w - -; Nxd8; N
